taos> EXPLAIN SELECT a.k1, b.k2, c.k3 FROM mt_a a, mt_b b, mt_c c WHERE a.k1 = b.k1 AND b.k2 = c.k2 \G;
*************************** 1.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN: -> Projection (columns=3 width=12 input_order=asc)
*************************** 2.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:    -> Inner Join (columns=4 width=16 input_order=asc algo=Hash)
*************************** 3.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:       -> Partition on Column k2 (width=12)
*************************** 4.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:          -> Inner Join (columns=3 width=12 input_order=asc algo=Hash)
*************************** 5.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:             -> Partition on Column k1 (width=12)
*************************** 6.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:                -> Table Scan on mt_a (columns=2 width=12 order=[asc|1 desc|0] mode=ts_order data_load=data)
*************************** 7.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:             -> Data Exchange 1:1 (width=16)
*************************** 8.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:                -> Partition on Column k1 (width=16)
*************************** 9.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:                   -> Table Scan on mt_b (columns=3 width=16 order=[asc|1 desc|0] mode=ts_order data_load=data)
*************************** 10.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:       -> Data Exchange 1:1 (width=16)
*************************** 11.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:          -> Partition on Column k2 (width=16)
*************************** 12.row ***************************
QUERY_PLAN:             -> Table Scan on mt_c (columns=3 width=16 order=[asc|1 desc|0] mode=ts_order data_load=data)

